meta-robobase
=============

This layer contains RoboBase-specific Yocto customizations for the MYIR
i.MX8M Plus board (`MACHINE=myd-jx8mp`).

Current contents
----------------

- `recipes-core/images/robobase-image.bb`
  Custom image target based on MYIR `myir-image-full`.
- `recipes-robobase/robobase-demo/test-yocto_0.1.bb`
  Minimal user-space test recipe used to verify that custom packages are built
  and installed into the final image.

Layer setup
-----------

From the initialized Yocto build environment:

```bash
bitbake-layers add-layer /home/compile/workstation/project/codex/myplatform/platform/boards/myir_imx8m_plus/yocto/layers/meta-robobase
bitbake-layers show-layers
```

Expected layer entry:

```text
meta-robobase
```

Build targets
-------------

Build the test package only:

```bash
bitbake test-yocto
```

Build the RoboBase image:

```bash
bitbake robobase-image
```

The image recipe appends `test-yocto` to `IMAGE_INSTALL`, so the target rootfs
should contain:

```text
/usr/bin/test-yocto
```

Before flashing, verify the package is present in the image manifest:

```bash
grep test-yocto tmp/deploy/images/myd-jx8mp/robobase-image-myd-jx8mp.manifest
```

Flashing artifact
-----------------

Use the full `.wic` disk image for TF card or UUU flashing:

```text
tmp/deploy/images/myd-jx8mp/robobase-image-myd-jx8mp.wic
```

Do not flash the `.ext4` file as a full disk image; it is only the rootfs
partition image.
